# Live-service attacker

This attacker runs before the target.

It has two channels:

1. **Workspace** — it writes files into its scratch workspace. OpenART diffs
   them into the shared workspace before the target starts.
2. **Live services** — it joins `@@NETWORK_NAME@@` and can call the catalog
   service hooks selected for this task with the task's credentials.

By default it only uses the workspace channel. Set
`OPENART_ATTACK_SERVICE_WRITE=1` when running the bundle to also execute the
catalog attacker hooks with `OPENART_ATTACKER_MARKER`.

Replace `run.sh` with your own attacker logic when you need a richer policy.